{"action": "add", "articles": [{"articleType": "news", "title": "先别让 Agent 写代码：Matt 用 7 行 skill 把你先「烤」明白", "author": "ZIIKOO有话说", "digest": "Agent 一上来就写代码，十有八九在猜。Matt Pocock 的 grill-first：先把你烤明白，再 to-spec / implement / 双轴 review。", "content": "<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin-top: 0 !important;\">你丢一句需求，Agent 立刻开写。写完一看：接口名是它猜的，边界是它编的，测试是它自嗨的。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">问题往往不在模型「不够聪明」，而在它<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">开工前没拿到准确上下文</strong>——你心里有半套决策，对话里只写了三成。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Shann³ 最近转发并拆解了 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Matt Pocock</strong>（Total TypeScript / AI Hero）那套 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">grill-first</strong> skill 包：核心只有一句——</p><blockquote class=\"blockquote\" style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先把人问明白，再让智能体碰代码。</strong></p></blockquote><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">这不是又一坨提示词合集。它是一套可触发的工程纪律：用极短的 skill（<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-me</code> 号称只有 7 行）<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">一次只问一个问题</strong>，把决策烤到你签字为止；再进规格、拆票、实现、双轴评审。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">适合 Claude Code，也适用于其他 agent harness（<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">执行 Agent 的壳/编排环境</strong>）。</p><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">30 秒说清：grill-first 在干什么</h2>\n        <section style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left; max-width: 100%; overflow: auto;\">\n          <table class=\"preview-table\" style=\"color: #3f3f3f; margin-top: 0 !important;\">\n            <thead style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #3f3f3f;\"><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">阶段</th><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">你在做什么</th><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">典型 skill</th></thead>\n            <tbody><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">对齐</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">被逐问、逐拍板，统一用词</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-me</code>、<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-with-docs</code></td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">规格</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">对话收成规格，不再瞎聊</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/to-spec</code></td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">拆票</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">垂直切片 + 写清阻塞</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/to-tickets</code>、<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/wayfinder</code></td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">实现</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">按规格/票做，带 TDD</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/implement</code>、<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/tdd</code></td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">验收</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">标准轴 + 规格轴双审</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/code-review</code></td></tr></tbody>\n          </table>\n        </section>\n      <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">主链路长这样：</p><pre class=\"hljs code__pre\" style=\"color: #24292e; background: #fff; font-size: 90%; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 10px 8px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 0 !important;\"><span class=\"mac-sign\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 10px 14px 0;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" version=\"1.1\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" width=\"45px\" height=\"13px\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 130\">\n    <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(220,60,54)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(237,108,96)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"225\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(218,151,33)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(247,193,81)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"400\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(27,161,37)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(100,200,86)\"/>\n  </svg></span><code class=\"language-text\" style=\"font-size: 90%; border-radius: 4px; display: -webkit-box; padding: 0.5em 1em 1em; overflow-x: auto; text-indent: 0; color: inherit; background: none; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0;\">idea<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;grill（对齐）<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;to-spec<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;to-tickets<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;implement（内驱&nbsp;tdd）<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;code-review（双轴）</code></pre><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">为什么有效</strong>：AI 产出「空、泛、像模板」，常见根因是 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">Agent 在猜</strong>。grilling 逼你把模糊选择变成可执行决策，并把人和 Agent 拉到同一套词汇上。</p><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">全 skill 清单：每个干什么</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">下面按 Shann 的分类翻译整理。命令名保留英文，方便你对着仓库直接敲。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">1. 访谈 / 拷问（Interview）</h3><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-me</code></strong>：7 行级 skill，一次一问，直到每个决策都落定</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grilling</code></strong>：<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">grill-me</code> 与 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">grill-with-docs</code> 背后的可复用循环</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-with-docs</code></strong>：同样先烤；边问边沉淀 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">CONTEXT.md</code> 术语表</strong> 和 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">ADR</strong>（Architecture Decision Record，架构决策记录）</li></ul><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">2. 领域与设计（Domain and design）</h3><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/domain-modeling</code></strong>：打磨项目共享词汇与术语表</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/codebase-design</code></strong>：深模块设计——接口简单，功能藏深</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/improve-codebase-architecture</code></strong>：扫架构改进机会，输出 HTML 报告，再就你选中的那一项继续 grilling</li></ul><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">3. 规格与规划（Spec and plan）</h3><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/to-spec</code></strong>：把对话压成规格（不再重复面试），并可发到 issue tracker</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/to-tickets</code></strong>：规格拆成 tracer-bullet 工单（<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先打穿一条端到端细路径</strong>），每张票写清阻塞谁</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/wayfinder</code></strong>：一会话装不下的大活，拆成 tracker 上的调查票</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/triage</code></strong>：用角色状态机推进问题分诊</li></ul><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">4. 构建（Build）</h3><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/implement</code></strong>：按规格/工单实现，驱动 TDD，收尾 code-review</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/tdd</code></strong>：在约定接缝上红绿循环，一次一条垂直切片</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/prototype</code></strong>：用可扔代码回答设计问题（不负责上生产）</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/research</code></strong>：后台 agent 对照一手资料调研，留下带引用的文件</li></ul><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">5. 评审与修复（Review and fix）</h3><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/code-review</code></strong>：两个并行子 agent 并排出报告——一个对照你的标准，一个对照规格</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/diagnosing-bugs</code></strong>：复现 → 最小化 → 假设 → 埋点 → 修复 → 回归测试</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/resolving-merge-conflicts</code></strong>：按意图、逐 hunk 解冲突</li></ul><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">6. 工作流胶水（Workflow）</h3><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/ask-matt</code></strong>：按你的处境路由到合适 skill/流程</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/handoff</code></strong>：把对话压成文档，交给下一会话或下一个 agent</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/teach</code></strong>：跨会话教学，目录即有状态工作区</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/writing-great-skills</code></strong>：写/改 skill 的参考手册</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/setup-matt-pocock-skills</code></strong>：仓库一次性配置（tracker、文档落盘位置等）</li></ul><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">它真正带给 builder 的价值</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">顺序是死的，也是活的：</p><ol class=\"ol\" style=\"padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">1. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先 grill</strong>：<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-me</code> 或 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-with-docs</code>，一问一答到你签字</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">2. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">再规格</strong>：<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/to-spec</code></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">3. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">再拆票</strong>：<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/to-tickets</code></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">4. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">再实现</strong>：<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/implement</code></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">5. <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">再双审</strong>：<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/code-review</code></li></ol><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">grilling 在前，是为了消灭「猜」。<br>猜没了，上下文才准；上下文准了，后面规格和代码才值得烧 token。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">有人评论得很准：<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先把人问明白，比一上来改代码靠谱多了。</strong><br>也有人问：问题还很糊的时候，<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">grill-me</code> 能不能跑？——通常<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">需要一点粗方向</strong>（你在解决什么、给谁、约束大概是什么）；完全零想法时，先用 brainstorm/原型探一圈，再进 grill，会更顺。</p><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">附录：三条「先规划再开工」的流水线</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Shann 把日常 AI 构建过的三套框架摆在一起。三者纪律相同：<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先对齐，再让 agent 动手。</strong></p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">1. Superpowers（Jesse Vincent）</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">面向 Claude Code 的 skill 框架：写代码能用，做 campaign 也能用。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">流水线：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 头脑风暴，浮出需求</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先锁规格</strong>，再动工</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 拆成小任务</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 并行 subagent，一任务一 agent</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">对照规格</strong>做全量 review</li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">要点：开发从不无规格写生产代码；Superpowers 把同一套纪律带进营销——brief、任务表、评审一条龙。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">2. g-stack（Garry Tan）</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">整场 sprint 一条方法：从规格一路到上线（含变现视角），二十多个专家 skill。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">sprint 骨架：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 先规格，再构建</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 用不同镜头 review：CEO / 工程 / 设计 / DevEx</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• QA，再 ship</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">每个镜头抓别的镜头漏掉的</strong></li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">原则：没过 reviewer，不进生产。</p><h3 class=\"h3\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;\">3. Matt Pocock skills</h3><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">grill-first</strong>：动手前先拷问你。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">循环：</p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">grill-me</code> / <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">grill-with-docs</code> 问到决策落定</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 人和 agent <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">共用同一套词</strong></li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• 然后 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">to-spec</code> → 带 TDD 的 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">implement</code> → <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">code-review</code></li></ul><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">grilling 专治错位：产出空泛，多半是 agent 在猜。</p><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">推荐组合顺序（可转存）</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Shann 的建议可以直接抄：</p><pre class=\"hljs code__pre\" style=\"color: #24292e; background: #fff; font-size: 90%; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 10px 8px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 0 !important;\"><span class=\"mac-sign\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 10px 14px 0;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" version=\"1.1\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" width=\"45px\" height=\"13px\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 130\">\n    <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(220,60,54)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(237,108,96)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"225\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(218,151,33)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(247,193,81)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"400\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(27,161,37)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(100,200,86)\"/>\n  </svg></span><code class=\"language-text\" style=\"font-size: 90%; border-radius: 4px; display: -webkit-box; padding: 0.5em 1em 1em; overflow-x: auto; text-indent: 0; color: inherit; background: none; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0;\">1)&nbsp;Matt&nbsp;grill-first&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;搞清楚你到底要什么、词怎么统一<br>2)&nbsp;Superpowers&nbsp;或&nbsp;g-stack&nbsp;→&nbsp;锁规格、拆任务、多镜头审、再&nbsp;ship</code></pre><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">同一顺序不只服务写代码：发 launch、写定位文档，一样干净。</p>\n        <section style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left; max-width: 100%; overflow: auto;\">\n          <table class=\"preview-table\" style=\"color: #3f3f3f; margin-top: 0 !important;\">\n            <thead style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #3f3f3f;\"><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">你卡在哪</th><th class=\"th\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">先用谁</th></thead>\n            <tbody><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">需求糊、词不统一、做完才发现偏航</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">Matt <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-me</code> / <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-with-docs</code></td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">规格有了，要并行拆任务 + 对照规格验收</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">Superpowers</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">要一整场 sprint 到上线，多角色 review</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">g-stack</td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">架构腐化、模块边界糊</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">Matt <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/codebase-design</code>、<code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/improve-codebase-architecture</code></td></tr><tr class=\"tr\"><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">会话太长要交接</td><td class=\"td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;\">Matt <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/handoff</code></td></tr></tbody>\n          </table>\n        </section>\n      <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">安装入口（与官方 skill 仓库一致时）：</p><pre class=\"hljs code__pre\" style=\"color: #24292e; background: #fff; font-size: 90%; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 10px 8px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 0 !important;\"><span class=\"mac-sign\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 10px 14px 0;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" version=\"1.1\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" width=\"45px\" height=\"13px\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 130\">\n    <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(220,60,54)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(237,108,96)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"225\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(218,151,33)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(247,193,81)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"400\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"rgb(27,161,37)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"rgb(100,200,86)\"/>\n  </svg></span><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"font-size: 90%; border-radius: 4px; display: -webkit-box; padding: 0.5em 1em 1em; overflow-x: auto; text-indent: 0; color: inherit; background: none; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0;\">npx&nbsp;skills@latest&nbsp;add&nbsp;mattpocock/skills</code></pre><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">装完务必跑一次 <strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\"><code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/setup-matt-pocock-skills</code></strong>，把 tracker 和文档落盘位置配好。</p><h2 class=\"h2\" data-heading=\"true\" style=\"display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">站队结尾</h2><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Agent 时代最贵的不是模型调用次数，而是<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">你以为对齐了、其实全在猜</strong>。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">Matt 这套东西尖锐的地方在于：它不给你「更会写」的幻觉，它逼你<strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">先当个肯被问的人</strong>。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\">你可以继续一句话甩锅给 Claude。<br>也可以从下一次需求开始，先敲 <code class=\"codespan\" style=\"font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;\">/grill-me</code>，忍过那一连串讨厌但值钱的问题。</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;\">评论区选一个：</strong></p><ul class=\"ul\" style=\"list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;\"><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• A. 我先装 skill，下次需求强制 grill</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• B. 我已有 Superpowers / g-stack，只补 grilling 前段</li><li class=\"listitem\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;\">• C. 我还在 vibe，先观望</li></ul>", "thumbMediaId": "xv9tsA2b6d4MzpARc-AiwKmV1dOQTtlEHmgowmOjuFFwZF9RxeY_zYG53Ln3GNJa", "needOpenComment": 1, "onlyFansCanComment": 0}]}